Recommends: libkf6config-bin, plasma-workspace, systemsettings, power-profiles-daemon,
 network-manager, ufw, filelight, partitionmanager
Description: M OS system applications
 The original M OS applications:
  * M OS Welcome — first-login setup (layout, theme, performance, privacy)
  * M OS Control Center — all system settings in one place
  * M OS Update Center — check for and install Debian updates
  * M OS System Monitor — CPU, memory, disks, network, processes, sensors
  * M OS About — version and hardware summary
  * mos-desktopctl — command-line desktop configuration tool
